# The repository stores text as LF and checks it out as LF on every platform.
# Contributors may work on Windows, but the dev container that builds and runs
# this extension is Linux. A CRLF checkout breaks shell scripts at the shebang
# and turns ordinary edits into whole-file diffs against upstream.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never EOL-convert these.
*.png  binary
*.vsix binary
